d <code style="">StringRedisTemplate</code></span><span style=""><sup class="superscript"></sup></span><span style="">.</span></span></p></li><li><p id="p-rc_031a66cb11274453-293"><span style="font-size: 19px; color: light-dark(transparent, rgb(0, 255, 128));"><span><b>Kafka Producer Integration:</b> Publish the immutable <code>ReservationEvent</code> to the <code>reservation.pending</code> topic directly after a successful Redis hold</span><span><sup class="superscript"></sup></span><span>.</span></span></p></li><li><p id="p-rc_031a66cb11274453-294"><span style="font-size: 19px; color: light-dark(transparent, rgb(0, 255, 128));"><span><b>Downstream Worker Implementation:</b> Build the <code>Order &amp; Payment Worker</code> to consume the Kafka event, check PostgreSQL for duplicate idempotency keys, and run the mock payment logic</span><span><sup class="superscript"></sup></span><span>.</span></span></p></li><li><p id="p-rc_031a66cb11274453-295"><span style="font-size: 19px; color: light-dark(transparent, rgb(0, 255, 128));"><span style=""><b>Saga Compensating Rollback:</b> Implement the <code>reservation.failed</code> listener to trigger <code>INCR</code> in Redis if payment fails or times out</span><span style=""><sup class="superscript"></sup></span><span style="">.</span></span></p></li></ol></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="394" y="975" fill="#000000" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"><tspan x="394" y="975">Order For Implementation</tspan><tspan x="394" y="989">The Core Gateway Flow: Finalize the POST /api/v1/reservations controller along with the ReservationService using the atomic Lua script and</tspan><tspan x="394" y="1003">StringRedisTemplate.Kafka Producer Integration: Publish the immutable ReservationEvent to the reservation.pending topic directly after a successful Redis</tspan><tspan x="394" y="1017">hold.Downstream Worker Implementation: Build the Order &amp; Payment Worker to consume the Kafka event, check PostgreSQL for duplicate idempotency keys,</tspan><tspan x="394" y="1031">and run the mock payment logic.Saga Compensating Rollback: Implement the reservation.failed listener to trigger INCR in Redis if payment fails or times out.</tspan></text></switch></g></g></g></g></g></g><switch><g requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"/><a transform="translate(0,-5)" xlink:href="https://www.drawio.com/doc/faq/svg-export-text-problems" target="_blank"><text text-anchor="middle" font-size="10px" x="50%" y="100%">Text is not SVG - cannot display</text></a></switch></svg>